# 3. CORE PRODUCT ARCHITECTURE

Build FormForge AI around two independent but integrated processing engines.

## ENGINE A: FORM INTELLIGENCE AND ACROFORM CONVERSION ENGINE

This engine converts ordinary PDFs into genuine fillable PDF master templates.

Its responsibilities include:

- PDF ingestion.
- PDF structural inspection.
- Text extraction.
- Vector analysis.
- Page and layout analysis.
- OCR.
- Automatic field detection.
- Semantic field classification.
- Field coordinate calculation.
- Confidence scoring.
