- AcroForm generation.
- Field property configuration.
- PDF integrity validation.
- Template version management.

## ENGINE B: FORM RENDERING AND DOCUMENT GENERATION ENGINE

This engine uses approved fillable master templates to process actual user submissions.

Its responsibilities include:

- Loading an approved template.
- Receiving structured form data.
- Mapping data to the correct AcroForm fields.
- Validating submitted information.
- Populating the fields.
- Regenerating field appearances.
- Flattening the completed document when required.
- Generating the final PDF.
- Secure downloading.
- Printing.
- Managing signed document uploads where configured.

These engines must remain logically independent.

The conversion engine must not be confused with the online form-filling application.

A future customer-facing application must be able to use templates generated by FormForge AI through an API without needing to access the conversion studio.

