**RULE 10: KEEP THE CODE MAINTAINABLE.**

Use clear modules, documented interfaces, proper types and separation of responsibilities.

**RULE 11: NO UNNECESSARY PAID DEPENDENCIES.**

The core conversion engine must be owned and operated by us. Prefer open-source libraries and self-hosted processing. Optional commercial AI integrations must not be mandatory for basic conversion.

**RULE 12: DO NOT COMPROMISE SECURITY.**

Treat every uploaded PDF and all customer information as untrusted and confidential.

